OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly light
OL,6,Frain will continue across many areas
OL,7,Fthrough the evening, becoming
OL,8,Fincreasingly sporadic later in the
OL,9,Fnight and largely confined to higher
OL,10,Fground, with many places turning dry.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA cloudy start with early
OL,13,Fpatchy rain soon clearing away. Sunny
OL,14,Fspells and scattered showers will
OL,15,Fdevelop around lunchtime, becoming
OL,16,Fheavy, widespread and potentially
OL,17,Fthundery by late afternoon and evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
